Add an authorization check (e.g., onlyOwner or pause guardian) and add explicit balance validation before the unchecked block, or remove unchecked entirely:


function emergencyWithdraw(address token, uint128 amount) external {
    if (balances[msg.sender][token] < amount) revert InsufficientBalance();
    balances[msg.sender][token] -= amount;
    totalDeposits[token] -= amount;
    IERC20(token).safeTransfer(msg.sender, amount);
    emit Withdrawn(msg.sender, token, amount);
}

Consider also restricting this function to an owner/admin role.

